      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4461,
      "text": "[It will be said], “Seize him and drag him into the midst of the Blazing Fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 498,
      "ruku": 433,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4462,
      "text": "Then pour over his head the torment of scalding water.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 498,
      "ruku": 433,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4463,
      "text": "“Taste this. You are surely the mighty and honorable![12]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 498,
      "ruku": 433,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4464,
      "text": "This is what you [all] used to doubt.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 498,
      "ruku": 433,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4465,
      "text": "Indeed, the righteous will be in a safe place,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
