      "ruku": 433,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4467,
      "text": "wearing fine silk and heavy brocade, facing one another.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 498,
      "ruku": 433,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4468,
      "text": "So it will be, and We will marry them to maidens with gorgeous eyes.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 498,
      "ruku": 433,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4469,
      "text": "They will call therein for every kind of fruit, safe and secure.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 498,
      "ruku": 433,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4470,
      "text": "They will not taste death therein except the first death, and He will protect them from the punishment of the Blazing Fire,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 498,
      "ruku": 433,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4471,
      "text": "as a grace from your Lord. That is the supreme triumph.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
